    "summary": "Errata to the Effect of [Dark Apparitions](vsdata:ability/emperors-children.carnival-of-excess.dark-apparitions): both 9″ distances become 8″. In the Reinforcements step of your next Movement phase, the returning **DAEMONETTES** therefore:\n\n- may arrive by **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** more than 6″ horizontally from every enemy unit, instead of more than 8″\n- must be set up wholly within 8″ of at least 1 friendly **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** unit",
